<title>USA: Westminster, Colo., $30 mln, yields 5.60 pct.</title>
<headline>Westminster, Colo., $30 mln, yields 5.60 pct.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hanifen, Imhoff Inc said it repriced $30.290 million of Westminster, Colo., sales and tax use revenue bonds, series 1997A, with a top yield of 5.60 percent in 2016.</p>
</text>
